# ENG-141: the reminder plan a new trial user gets, read from the real pending
# notification queue. Fresh install, walk onboarding to the app-blocking step (the
# trial is granted when that screen appears, after reminders were first planned),
# then dump pending notifications to OSLog with no apps chosen and read app.log:
# the queue must already hold the smart follow-ups, the day-10/13 warnings with the
# reminders-only body, and the day-15 expiry-day notice. Every `Pillie QA pending:`
# line names id, fire time, title, and body. A fresh install is post-cutover, so
# every trial notice carries the hard-paywall pick-a-plan body and `_hard_` id;
# none may say daily reminders stay free (ENG-161).
# "Yes" logs a 1-day streak, so the next base reminder reads "Take today’s pill to
# keep your 1-day streak going." with a `_streak1_` id; later days keep the plain
# body (ENG-168).
#
# Not covered here: the blocking-cohort copy. It needs a real FamilyControls
# selection, and the plus-app-blocking-setup seam that fakes one also forces Plus on,
# which removes the trial notices. TrialExpiryWarningPlannerTests covers the swap.

fresh
launch
sleep 6  # the welcome CTA ignores taps while the splash fades
log start

wait id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA
shot welcome
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait id protectionPlanEarlyValueProofView
tap --label "Not now" --element-type Button

wait text "What’s in the way?"
tap --label TikTok
tap --label "A simpler routine"
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait text "How often do you miss your pill?"
tap --label Rarely
tap --label "Right after the reminder"
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait text "Where did you find Pillie?"
tap --id acquisitionSource.tiktok
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait text "Pick your method."
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait text "Tap the pill you’re on today."
tap --id packTile.12
wait id todayPillQuestion
tap --id todayPillYes
wait id todayPillLogged
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait text "Pick a time."
tap --label Evening
wait text "Pill 12 · taken"
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA
tap --label Allow  # iOS notification permission alert

wait id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA 15
tap --id protectionPlanPrimaryCTA

wait id appBlockingEmptyStateCard 15
shot app-blocking-before-apps
sleep 2  # let the 0.25 s reschedule debounce and the center writes finish
openurl "pillie://debug/dump-pending-notifications"
sleep 2

log stop
